<section vertical-align="center">
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item>
      <h2>History detective quiz</h2>
      <p>Use the map, objects, timeline, and viewpoints to solve each question.</p>
      <grid padding-top="34pt" spacing="medium" marker="number" marker-position="above" marker-align="start" marker-style="solid" marker-shape="circle" marker-size="large">
        <grid-item colspan="20" cell-style="subtle">
          <h4>Find the place</h4>
          <p>Which Brazilian state is at the center of this story?</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="20" cell-style="subtle">
          <h4>Find the causes</h4>
          <p>Name two kinds of disagreement behind the conflict.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="20" cell-style="subtle">
          <h4>Compare viewpoints</h4>
          <p>Why might the same event feel different to a free seller and an enslaved worker?</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
      <grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug">
        <grid-item background-color="surface" padding="12pt 16pt">
          <p><b>Check:</b> Rio Grande do Sul · trade and taxes, regional power, or republican separation · people did not have equal rights or choices.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
      <grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug">
        <grid-item background-color="accent" padding="16pt 18pt">
          <p role="eyebrow">Final detective question</p>
          <h3>Whose voice might still be missing?</h3>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>